eal) vs the ANNEALED ctrl (coef 1.0->0.05), at REFERENCE capacity (128-wide, 3x budget, z_world detached, credit-replay 3/topk 32), on BOTH z_world and raw 5x5. Verdict: treat clears the ~13.05 lift-competence target (5.22 plateau + 7.83 margin) AND beats its ctrl arm by >= the lift margin, on a strict majority of seeds, on EITHER representation; readiness = local_view_greedy + oracle clear the 1.0 floor @D3.", "notes": "MECH-457 GOV-FANOUT-1 H1 (drive-schedule / ordering) discrimination, routed by failure_autopsy_V3-EXQ-769_2026-07-17. DIAGNOSTIC (excluded from scoring); PROMOTES/DEMOTES NOTHING; route to /failure-autopsy (read jointly with H2 V3-EXQ-771 + H3 V3-EXQ-772). Manipulation = the intrinsic-drive ANNEAL SCHEDULE only (ctrl annealed 1.0->0.05, treat sustained constant 1.0), capacity/converter/budget/env/reward held fixed at the NON-REGRESSED reference (128-wide/3x/detached; NOT the 769-falsified 256/5x). RE-DERIVE BRAKE: PERMITS -- new EXQ NUMBER on a DIFFERENT design axis (drive), the GOV-FANOUT-1 sanctioned route the 769 autopsy names; the brake refuses only another capacity/same-axis re-pose. NULL (sustained drive still forages ~0 both reps) -> drive-schedule is NOT the axis; removes H1, does NOT weaken MECH-457. MECH-457 stays candidate/v3_pending. Anti-alias vs H3: H1 moves the intrinsic-coef schedule (novelty timing); H3 moves extrinsic forage-credit density. On D3 the passive-survival optimum is learned SELF-CONTAMINATION-AVOIDANCE (not 'do nothing'), so 'avoidance without approach' = keep-moving-to-fresh-cells without foraging.", "recording_schema": "rec/v1", "substrate_hash": "f56e1a7e1ce7721b9e4dd91b4da668f397ec005ce360cb0cdabd66610f2bbbde", "machine": "ree-cloud-2", "machine_class": "linux-x86_64-py3.10", "elapsed_seconds": 23974.903102, "seeds": [42, 43, 44], "queue_id": "V3-EXQ-770"}